  "contentHtml": "<div>\r\n<div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 10px; PADDING-LEFT: 10px; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199)\">\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 19px\"><b><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div>\r\n<p>달과 금성의 위상변화 동영상입니다<br></p>\r\n<p><iframe id=\"ve59feBf1fefeElB9e29E9u\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/ve59feBf1fefeElB9e29E9u?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZlNTlmZUJmMWZlZmVFbEI5ZTI5RTl1IiwidGlkIjoiMzExZWFkOGYtNGQxMy00NmMzLWJmZTEtNjJiMmY5ZjdkZTAzIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NTYxfQ.44y3JEsk1x-rWCKKLc3WCNLZGZYvM1FyW1EOdIywraMDCRJyuk8nd-h7UTYyfoIStHuyBrjnsKebt6v50QoZdg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1229%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20150401163704&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile289.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F21343650551BA0060D78B4')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_movie_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 금성의위상변화.avi</a><div class='embedPlayer'><object classid='CLSID:22d6f312-b0f6-11d0-94ab-0080c74c7e95' CODEBASE='ht